# Load-bearing. Do not delete this file, and do not delete this directory even
# if it is ever emptied.
#
# web/content/ is one of the three UNCONDITIONAL walk roots of the
# client-directive source scan in web/scripts/check-html-locks.mjs (the other
# two are web/app and design-system/src). That scan is a bare readdirSync
# recursion with no existsSync guard, on purpose: a scan that skips a missing
# directory goes silently quiet the moment the directory is renamed, and then
# proves nothing forever. So the directory must exist from wave 1 even though
# plan 02-06 does not add its first real data module until wave 3.
#
# Without this file `npm run check:html` throws ENOENT inside the required
# `build` job, on a branch whose ruleset has no bypass actors.
